WEBVTT

00:00:00.111 --> 00:00:09.543
This video shows how to create a class timetable on your phone. You will pick a class, give one period a subject, and save the timetable.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:16.874
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Academics, and then choose Timetable.

00:00:18.747 --> 00:00:29.427
Tap the class list and choose the class whose timetable you want to create. The days of the week appear below, and the periods of the open day are listed with their times.

00:00:29.887 --> 00:00:43.279
Tap a period that says Tap to assign. Choose the subject for that period and tap Set. The teacher assigned to the subject is filled in for you, and the period now shows the subject and the teacher.

00:00:50.469 --> 00:01:00.261
Scroll up and tap Save Timetable. A message at the top says that the timetable was saved. Students and parents can now see it.

00:01:10.534 --> 00:01:18.118
The timetable is saved. Repeat these steps for the other periods and days, and for the other classes.
